gpu-unlock: Zagitta/gpu-unlock right before the NVIDIA driver at boot, so that
gpu-unlock: RTX 30 series cards named on the kernel command line run FP16 and
gpu-unlock: BF16 at full rate. Fetches the module built for the running Unraid
